{"w":2400,"lines":[{"w":0.072168534596761091,"c":1,"x":0.83943013586292858,"y":0.11461347408814815,"h":0.013505609914467365,"t":"Reading"},{"y":0.15398111425595506,"h":0.014357409572713697,"t":"in the Netherlands - and this time he succeeded in arousing the interest of the","x":0.22012974239153607,"w":0.64617248535156258,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.016024323880180935,"t":"Dutch Ministry of Transport.iTimes had changed,' he recalls. 'People had become","w":0.67283950805664061,"x":0.22427983660953979,"y":0.1686046513142867},{"h":0.01453488398216074,"w":0.63580245971679683,"t":"more environmentally conscious, and the Danish experiment had proved that","c":1,"x":0.22222222688548071,"y":0.18604651149362128},{"h":0.016039732066986834,"c":1,"y":0.20053003551438675,"t":"bike-sharing was a real possibility.' A new Witte Fietsenplan was launched in 1999","x":0.2222222294123814,"w":0.67489710489908861},{"c":1,"x":0.22012946864658639,"y":0.2159921618449181,"t":"in Amsterdam. However, riding a white bike was no longer free; it cost one guilder","h":0.015727282974548729,"w":0.67499399820963535},{"c":1,"x":0.22222222596644259,"h":0.01453488398216074,"y":0.23255813940013925,"w":0.64197530110677081,"t":"per trip and payment was made with a chip card developed by the Dutch bank"},{"x":0.22216298290622016,"y":0.24668631707530531,"t":"Postbank. Schimmelpennink designed conspicuous, sturdy white bikes locked","w":0.64211568196614588,"c":1,"h":0.017651083893433395},{"c":1,"x":0.22016461835677015,"y":0.26295641950390358,"t":"in special racks which could be opened with the chip card - the plan started with","w":0.66255142211914064,"h":0.014723203769140047},{"t":"250 bikes, distributed over five stations.","h":0.017455556507807057,"w":0.32921811421712244,"x":0.22222221849549528,"y":0.27906976727889288,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.014723203769140047,"y":0.30948174314635235,"x":0.21604939455275912,"w":0.6440328979492187,"t":"Theo Molenaar, who was a system designer for the project, worked alongside"},{"y":0.32412790682996895,"h":0.015988372380376759,"w":0.68930043538411456,"c":1,"x":0.22222221021850827,"t":"Schimmelpennink. 'I remember when we were testing the bike racks, he announced"},{"w":0.68724278767903646,"t":"that he had already designed better ones. But of course, we had to go through with","y":0.34010600698380333,"c":1,"x":0.22016461439604654,"h":0.015998644317698929},{"c":1,"t":"the ones we had' The system, however, was prone to vandalism and theft. 'After","y":0.35304674722163132,"w":0.66681808471679693,"x":0.22009603546772308,"h":0.020071768788763378},{"t":"every weekend there would always be a couple of bikes missing,' Molenaar says.","x":0.22422935687545362,"c":1,"h":0.015333718208879077,"w":0.66880879720052078,"y":0.36994655108203944},{"w":0.66255142211914064,"t":"'I really have no idea what people did with them, because they could instantly be","x":0.22222223138291763,"h":0.014534883982160629,"y":0.38662790684017212,"c":1},{"x":0.22010253215148623,"c":1,"t":"recognised as white bikes.?' But the biggest blow came when Postbank decided to","y":0.40102307697629547,"h":0.017016893842896952,"w":0.67091013590494797},{"w":0.68743459065755208,"t":"abolish the chip card, because it wasn't profitable. 'That chip card was pivotal to the","x":0.22213589542141543,"y":0.41573280158659931,"h":0.018159561921064715,"c":1},{"x":0.22222222493268562,"y":0.43168433428452491,"c":1,"t":"system, Molenaar says. 'To continue the project we would have needed to set up","w":0.66872426350911462,"h":0.017443572112893269},{"w":0.48596399943033852,"x":0.22207244422210845,"c":1,"t":"another system, but the business partner had lost interest.'","y":0.44615364236887789,"h":0.019836972824114563},{"w":0.68530563354492191,"x":0.21394462674074191,"h":0.017202271729953478,"t":"Schimmelpennink was disappointed, but - characteristically - not for long. In 2002","c":1,"y":0.47782458333308464},{"c":1,"w":0.68948176066080735,"t":"he got a call from the French advertising corporation JC Decaux, who wanted to set","h":0.018250843942235639,"x":0.2221373893390908,"y":0.49312971125423544},{"x":0.22222222840359326,"t":"up his bike-sharing scheme in Vienna.ỊThat went really well. After Vienna, they set","y":0.5101744184717214,"h":0.014560564106288587,"w":0.68106994628906259,"c":1},{"t":"up a system in Lyon. Then in 2007, Paris followed. That was a decisive moment in","c":1,"x":0.22222221209004961,"y":0.52616279055108006,"w":0.6769547526041666,"h":0.01598837238037687},{"c":1,"t":"the history of bike-sharing.' The huge and unexpected success of the Parisian","x":0.22222221777289594,"y":0.54063604266036835,"h":0.014723203769140158,"w":0.63991770426432293},{"h":0.018260971536625092,"x":0.22216995974829673,"w":0.68942103068033855,"c":1,"y":0.55493661742852562,"t":"bike-sharing programme, which now boasts more than 20,000 bicycles, inspired cities"},{"x":0.22420107344978854,"h":0.017066171509076633,"c":1,"y":0.5701350146145876,"t":"all over the world to set up their own schemes, all modelled on Schimmelpennink's.","w":0.66680440266927077},{"x":0.22427983441046573,"y":0.58568904593205118,"t":"'It's wonderful that this happened,' he says. 'But financially I didn't really benefit from","w":0.67283950805664061,"c":1,"h":0.016195524146054185},{"h":0.015882825682946744,"y":0.60169152544996662,"w":0.29654741923014327,"c":1,"t":"it, because I never filed for a patent.'","x":0.22211795407205984},{"x":0.21399177403147063,"w":0.58436213175455731,"t":"In Amsterdam today, 38% of all trips are made by bike and, along with","h":0.016041443962932944,"c":1,"y":0.63221437011685355},{"x":0.22216034210306532,"t":"Copenhagen, it is regarded as one of the two most cycle-friendly capitals in the","w":0.65035975138346347,"h":0.018163931524234012,"c":1,"y":0.64681097537881016},{"x":0.22213356756669403,"h":0.016650295369897483,"c":1,"t":"world - but the city never got another Witte Fietsenplan. Molenaar believes this","y":0.66295058028631437,"w":0.65037963867187498},{"t":"may be because everybody in Amsterdam already has a bike. Schimmelpennink,","x":0.22427982748794931,"y":0.67873969377310261,"w":0.66460906982421875,"c":1,"h":0.014574259835502645},{"h":0.01515690878788345,"x":0.2242319343673097,"t":"however, cannot see that this changes Amsterdam's need for a bike-sharing","w":0.62150161743164056,"y":0.69434906051323431,"c":1},{"t":"scheme. 'People who travel on the underground don't carry their bikes around.","x":0.22216228853774936,"y":0.70925397561028092,"w":0.64824966430664055,"h":0.016946445505526375,"c":1},{"y":0.72360714423676831,"h":0.017980512657210457,"c":1,"t":"But often they need additional transport to reach their final destination.' Although","x":0.2242167902574469,"w":0.65652094523111981},{"x":0.22213713726966888,"c":1,"t":"he thinks it is strange that a city like Amsterdam does not have a successful bike-","w":0.66890050252278643,"h":0.01728648937211863,"y":0.73955621426762386},{"h":0.018919173062058259,"x":0.22213230104097534,"y":0.75488255341744337,"c":1,"w":0.64422108968098957,"t":"sharing scheme, he is optimistic about the future. 'In the '60s we didn't stand a"},{"x":0.22427982825329934,"y":0.77179034162376037,"c":1,"w":0.65843622843424487,"h":0.01309337941721278,"t":"chance because people were prepared to give their lives to keep cars in the city."},{"h":0.014723203769140158,"c":1,"x":0.22427982429953677,"t":"But that mentality has totally changed. Today everybody longs for cities that are not","y":0.78769140139863414,"w":0.68312759399414069},{"y":0.80222738813219485,"t":"dominated by cars.'","x":0.22202799338431495,"w":0.16509967803955078,"h":0.017165868105399773,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.87063953472637468,"t":"21","h":0.011627907185728592,"x":0.88477366266395319,"w":0.024691357612609877}],"h":3395}